<section id="contact" class="contact-section">
    <p class="eyebrow">A project, a question, a good Linux story?</p>
    <h2>Say hi<span class="accent-dot">.</span></h2>
    <p>I'd like to hear <strong class="em">what you're working on</strong>. We are both humans, after all.</p>
    <div class="button-row"><a class="button button-primary" href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }} ↗</a><a class="button button-secondary" href="{{ site.linkedin }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">LinkedIn ↗</a><a class="text-link" href="/connect/">Other ways to reach me →</a></div>
    <details class="gpg-details"><summary>Prefer encrypted email?</summary><p>My GPG fingerprint:</p><code>{{ site.fingerprint }}</code><div class="button-row"><button class="button button-small" type="button" data-copy="{{ site.fingerprint }}" data-copy-label="GPG fingerprint">Copy fingerprint</button><a href="https://keys.openpgp.org/search?q=hi%40qusai.pro" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Get my public key ↗</a></div></details>
</section>
